msgid "The TLS handshake failed."
msgstr "El protocol inicial de SSL ha fallat."

#: spice/spiceview.cpp:893
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Check whether the server accepts TLS only on a separate port, and that its "
"certificate is trusted."
msgstr ""
"Comproveu si el servidor accepta TLS només en un port separat i que el seu "
"certificat és de confiança."

#: spice/spiceview.cpp:896
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label"
msgid "The server rejected the SPICE connection."
msgstr "El servidor ha rebutjat la connexió SPICE."

#: spice/spiceview.cpp:897
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Check that this port belongs to a SPICE server with a compatible protocol "
"version."
msgstr ""
"Comproveu que aquest port pertanyi a un servidor SPICE amb una versió de "
"protocol compatible."

#: spice/spiceview.cpp:907
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Make sure the virtual machine is running, and its SPICE display listens on "
"this address."
msgstr ""
"Assegureu-vos que la màquina virtual estigui funcionant i la seva pantalla "
"SPICE escolti en aquesta adreça."

